                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَثُقَ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>It was,</i> or <i>became, firm, stable, fast,</i>
or <i>strong;</i> (Msb;) <i>i. q.</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُحْكِمَ</span> (S, Mgh, K) [or
